":"069顗傳弟嵩與本061明三子相合；非賁嵩。"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family","book_id":"b-jinshu-061","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-061-ws7903772"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050","text":"及敦死，王含欲投王舒，王應勸含投彬。含曰：「大將軍平素與江州云何，汝欲歸之？」應曰：「此乃所以宜往也。江州當人強盛時，能立同異，此非常人所及。睹衰厄，必興湣惻。荊州守文，豈能意外行事！」含不從，遂共投舒，舒果沈含父子于江。彬聞應來，密具船以待之。既不至，深以為恨。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0001","start":1,"end":2,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"王含","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"王舒","kind":"person","person_id":"nbl_2bu_99w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"王應","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"含","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"彬","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"含","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"大將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"江州","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"應","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"江州","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"荊州","kind":"person","person_id":"nbl_2bu_99w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0093","start":93,"end":94,"surface":"含","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0100","start":100,"end":101,"surface":"舒","kind":"person","person_id":"nbl_2bu_99w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0102","start":102,"end":103,"surface":"舒","kind":"person","person_id":"nbl_2bu_99w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"含","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"彬","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line050:m0113","start":113,"end":114,"surface":"應","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":50,"last_line":50,"revision_id":2180533,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":false},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin","book_id":"b-jinshu-076","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-076-wangbin"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi:p001","text":"王羲之，字逸少，司徒導之從子也。祖正，尚書郎。父曠，淮南太守。元帝之過江也，曠首創其議。羲之幼訥於言，人未之奇。年十三，嘗謁周顗，顗察而異之。時重牛心炙，坐客未啖，顗先割啖羲之，於是始知名。及長，辯贍，以骨鯁稱，尤善隸書，為古今之冠，論者稱其筆勢，以為飄若浮雲，矯若驚龍。深為從伯敦、導所器重。時陳留阮裕有重名，為敦主簿。敦嘗謂羲之曰：「汝是吾家佳子弟，當不減阮主簿。」裕亦目羲之與王承、王悅為王氏三少。時太尉郗鑒使門生求女婿于導，導令就東廂遍觀子弟。門生歸，謂鑒曰：「王氏諸少並佳，然聞信至，咸自矜持。惟一人在東床坦腹食，獨若不聞。」鑒曰：「正此佳婿邪！」訪之，乃羲之也，遂以女妻之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"王羲之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDC